                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 422.11G93/737.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Quito</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-02-01">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 1, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Arbitrators have failed absolutely to agree, and Judge Miller leaves for home
                    February 4.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hartman</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
